<title>POLAND: DOMPLAST JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOMPLAST JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.30 vs   3.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.84 vs   8.53</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.87 vs   6.71</p>
<p> Sales		   65.91 vs  46.31</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    25.31 vs  44.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	42.99 vs  84.88</p>
<p> Operating profit    51.18 vs  81.25</p>
<p> Sales		  414.25 vs 338.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish household plastic products maker</p>
<p>is DomPlast.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
